            "notes": "## Round 1 ##\n---\n### \u26a1 Powers: ###\n- [Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212) is pretty much mandatory to start for a torpedo build, this might be the only round without much interpretation\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) for the torpedoes\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) for blastin'\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) is the safe play for now\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) can be nice for a little extra heal/damage, or [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) if you prefer it over [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) on such a mobile hero\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- You won't be playing too differently from normal 5v5 [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18) at this point, but you will have a lot of freedom with your torpedoes; try to never really have 2 of them saved up, keep firing them to maximize *impact*",
