            "notes": "## Round 2 ##\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689) is probably the most useful item to start out here, just do your best to stack Ability Power and/or an [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with what money you have left at this point \n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- Depending on how the previous round went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n- [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) will be a recurring theme if you're getting focused at all; the armor goes under your shields so this should be active pretty often\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- [Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689) can really help enable you to be aggressive with your torpedoes",
