            "notes": "## Round 5 ##\n---\n### \u26a1 Powers: ###\n- This is where you have to decide what type of game you want to be playing: full support by leaning into the ring (best against a [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) type of comp), or start scaling your blaster for damage and healing\n- [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) will enable fights and keep you alive in clutch situations, if you have good group play, this is the way\n- The alternative path is the blaster at this point to take matters into your own hands; grab [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) here to really start stacking how dangerous you are\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- If you went with [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) here, just take [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) to keep cooldowns lower and the torpedo *impact* high\n-If you went with [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4), [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) can help your blaster start to scale\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- [Lux Loop](item_afa69bd2-683f-486d-bc1e-e40d49281679) can be great with [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) if you can afford it\n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) can really start to gain value if you're struggling with heals\n- [Pulse Spike](item_6557a6d1-9c94-4635-9619-67257e26683e) and [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if you're switching over to the [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) route instead of [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) \n- Depending on how the previous rounds went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- With [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) engage with ring, but also for an instant burst of health when needed\n- With [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) really start to use your survivability plus weapon damage as you can to get picks of anyone out of place",
